# 统一换行符（做法改编自 Lithe-IDEA，按本仓库技术栈简化）：
# 文本文件一律以 LF 入库、检出也保持 LF，避免 Windows/Mac 混合团队协作时
# 的换行符漂移。Windows 下 VS Code / IDEA 均可直接编辑 LF 文件。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本例外：批处理必须 CRLF 才能被执行
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 常见二进制文件：禁止任何换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.go text eol=lf
